: "577882061118043", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974696_577882064451376_4792740693409704284_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e_QcDf1c-jEQ7kNvwGm5-zu&_nc_oc=AdkIN9HAfdIjAJRxorM2AkgaNdkiDclY3j-72TccUgBUkgcrRxVjCSFQPSJrsfbB9yo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsnC-uBrAeXKpXxENHwOjPiiiqoKkLxVTNSFh2s0OwiWQ&oe=6999ABC6"}, {"file_name": "com.ContentsDa.SeriesAndParallel.ContentsDaScienceExperiment-20231025-151006.png", "id": "356744670162456", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031482_356744673495789_3833849122654924917_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EkrA_YBhFzsQ7kNvwGCqT16&_nc_oc=AdkUfuMuvy1CbTDT9mzHxkdEfx4pfn6CbMYvuiatTreWvwE9r5BHsvoA6sdyjA40RNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsAf1hBHmLv66I2uO06U_mwKSWs7gDBHAnBVSloEW5bhQ&oe=6999B981"}, {"file_name": "com.ContentsDa.SeriesAndParallel.ContentsDaScienceExperiment-20231025-151143.png", "id": "714731990592634", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75429290_714731993925967_583255900706383564_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mtmUiQBCZz4Q7kNvwFjIdcH&_nc_oc=AdkWMIooK_yTjhUnc1UGeFH3xBJgVFeXblVs-on_1SgZqJUIsrmB7IXO-y0xfoes2ao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsuerL-G4OxjcZqoP0ILabv78hgfUbdP8C7D1qhfS4hLA&oe=6999B79E"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_EjUCakJTq3.png", "id": "2418446101880748", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035311_2418446105214081_3554888492584360068_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mhn26j7uXbQQ7kNvwHvQgJf&_nc_oc=AdmE7eNMlwfRwGDXZ-JO7P0KSjtaivTTXlz1ieKIi5q3_8PSeIlxfJf-Pt5OmwYWUvQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu6kej6gF7bWpKV0IA4ey_oN9x6sXv7ihWfq8tJQ1lFAg&oe=69999377"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_2MR52dGac8.png", "id": "1486326215384631", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982440_1486326218717964_8329439272038606988_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tBzdNJ1i3ZcQ7kNvwFxVvLM&_nc_oc=Adn7WlB4NFudo4x9YMDFilq7YMazyh-A-k2yL-TcWvH7L5WHeqhuZRE63ZojJVo0b5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvAZ7B8ctLl8bVdpjgZNYsjnFrze4e4Ku2n_gTw3DOqHA&oe=6999A9BB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Series and Parallel Circuits_Landscape.png", "id": "1127198011497505", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974458_1127198014830838_1851423349520752781_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SxT1oMXSFEEQ7kNvwFOWvSX&_nc_oc=AdkJdVTNyIWAQPFkVKClWxwRkVX4yusFnM8MF1TL8BMUhjHvxTxwmQGsZWAZvdzB754&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvqpiCZ_YiYeqonbkZLykFHiZ7qZKkHKOHV8VgT1sUayg&oe=69999ACB"}, "display_name": "Series and Parallel Circuits - ContentsDa Science Experiments", "keywords": ["experiment", "chemistry", "circuits", "science", "contentsda"], "long_description": "<Series connection of cells>\nThis is a method of connecting cells in a straight line, with different poles in the order of (+)(-), (+)(-). When the cells are connected in series, the bulb emits brighter light because the amount of current is large. \n1. When connecting two batteries in series, connect the different poles of the (+)(-), (+)(-) batteries side by side. \n\n<Parallel connection of cells\nNo matter how many batteries are connected, the light of the bulb will not be as bright as the series connection, so the batteries can be used longer. \n1. Connect two batteries in parallel. When connecting the batteries in parallel, insert the battery plugs into each other. \n     The (+)(+) and (-)(-) poles of electricity are connected.\n \n<Serial connection of bulbs\nThis is a way to connect the bulbs in one way without boiling. \nThe brightness of the bulbs is dim because the energy of the cell is shared, and when one bulb goes out, the rest of the bulbs go out. \n\n<Parallel connection of bulbs\nThis is a method of connecting bulbs by dividing the path of the current. Because the current travels in different paths, even if one bulb breaks, the remaining bulbs will light up. The brightness of the bulbs is similar to when only one bulb is connected. \n\nTo parallel two bulbs, you connect one bulb in series, and then plug one bulb socket into the other bulb socket. \n\n<Conclusion\nLearn the difference between paralleling light bulbs in series and paralleling battery energy in series", "short_description": "Dive into the basics of electricity with the Series and Parallel Circuits experiment. This engaging activity demonstrates how electrical circuits can be configured and how these configurations affect the overall electrical flow and resistance."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8714822878639008"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974668_915017959849885_2098356226718900418_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I_9Dd3fsNxcQ7kNvwGHt